      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Imports GPS tracks from running, cycling, walking, and hiking workouts. Existing phone or watch points are deduplicated automatically.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 30,
          "startingLine": 134
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Before deduplication, Moves creates a local snapshot so you can restore the previous state with one tap.",
