      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Moves will merge old duplicate places and moves. For duplicate stays at the same location/time, it keeps the one that best fits surrounding moves (or the longer stay if there is no move context). A snapshot is saved first so you can undo.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 224
        }
